#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/multi.rst:11
#: 08d28ee275024d939404a8d1fa8c4522
msgid "To use this feature, ensure all vehicles (real or SITL) have different SYSID_THISMAV parameter values. Use ``param set SYSID_THISMAV X`` to set this value in the MAVProxy console (where ``X`` is the id)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/multi.rst:13
#: 75e3af09a8324609a414008df11afdb2
msgid "Most MAVProxy modules are designed to talk to only 1 vehicle at a time. This is the active vehicle. To change which vehicle is active, use the Vehicle dropdown menu on the graphical console. All modules will then send any relevant commands to that vehicle only."
msgstr ""

